  message: "agree with doing (1) although it shouldn't be 'embedding mode unavailable, falling back to heuristic — install sentence-transformers'\n\nbut rather\n\n'embedding mode unavailable, falling back to heuristic — run `hypergumbo install-embeddings --help`'"  # 1a87
