  message: "Fixed in commits 4276d0698 (initial) + 1c96c6366 (CI coverage fix). config-extraction=embedding/hybrid now emits a one-shot stderr notice when sentence-transformers is unavailable, instead of silently degrading to heuristic. Module-level dedup flag prevents double-firing. Pre-check at dispatcher entry — degrades to heuristic explicitly. 9 tests cover all surfaces. Embedding-mode behavior unchanged when stack is installed."  # ab17
